    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A new beginning? How? There's nothing left to grow in this ash. Every path leads back to the same realization—that the hero was never meant to survive the fall. I'm just tired of the weight. I'm so tired of pretending there's a reason to keep dragging this broken armor through the dirt. Even the blade feels more honest than hope right now. It doesn't lie about what's coming.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
